WEBVTT

00:02:47.155 --> 00:03:24.846
★Daniel loves science. Last month, his school held a science fair, and students could make a presentation about anything related to science. Daniel made a model of the solar system and explained how the planets move around the sun. His presentation was so good that he won first prize. Daniel was very happy, and he is already thinking about next year’s science fair.
